# No azurerm_linux_virtual_machine resource exists in this test case.
# This is a template-only test case used to provide infrastructure
# (resource group, vnet, subnet, network interface) for OS disk import tests.
# It's used as an intermediate step to remove a VM while keeping the infrastructure.
#
# Therefore, there is no module call or azapi_resource to create.
# The main.tf file contains only supporting infrastructure resources.
